    "prompt": "Generate a Knolling-style image. For every shirt in the image, there is a pair of jeans located below it. To the left of the jeans is a sock, and to the right of the jeans is a shoe; these three items are aligned horizontally. Below the jeans, there is a horizontally aligned row consisting of a calculator, a remote, a mouse, and a lighter, arranged in that order from left to right. Finally, on the bottom side of the image and below the calculator, there is a bowl, which is larger than the fork located to its right.",
